(7450272, 1179061, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the splash of pink on this one. Normally I like to have it balanced out with a little someplace else, but I like the feeling of incomplete that it leaves, for some reason (I know, doesn''t make sense to me either, but that''s what came to mind. :)<br/>(already voted)</td>', 'I like the splash of pink on this one. Normally I like to have it balanced out with a little someplace else, but I like the feeling of incomplete that it leaves, for some reason (I know, doesn''t make sense to me either, but that''s what came to mind. :)(already voted)', '2016-04-14 20:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
