(7450274, 1179032, 103142, '<td valign="top">The rotating of this makes it intriguing. It would have been too straight forward horizontal. It makes you question when it''s this way. (already voted)</td>', 'The rotating of this makes it intriguing. It would have been too straight forward horizontal. It makes you question when it''s this way. (already voted)', '2016-04-14 20:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
