(7450281, 1179048, 103142, '<td valign="top">I wonder where the frying pan is supposed to be worn (for the dress code. :) I like that the watch wasn''t just in the pan but around a glove. (Already voted)</td>', 'I wonder where the frying pan is supposed to be worn (for the dress code. :) I like that the watch wasn''t just in the pan but around a glove. (Already voted)', '2016-04-14 20:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
