(7450302, 1179050, 114285, '<td valign="top">Cute composition. I would''ve gone for a plain T-shirt even though the t-shirt looks cute and I would''ve removed the picture at the back just for a nice clean look.  Great tones in the editing, bump.</td>', 'Cute composition. I would''ve gone for a plain T-shirt even though the t-shirt looks cute and I would''ve removed the picture at the back just for a nice clean look.  Great tones in the editing, bump.', '2016-04-14 21:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7450303, 1179032, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is kind of haphazardly been put together,  cropped in the wrong spot and doesn''t look like it''s been rotated. T-shirt needs needs ironing and the composition is clumsy. The only good thing going for it is the window light, and I say that in the nicest possible way.</td>', 'This is kind of haphazardly been put together,  cropped in the wrong spot and doesn''t look like it''s been rotated. T-shirt needs needs ironing and the composition is clumsy. The only good thing going for it is the window light, and I say that in the nicest possible way.', '2016-04-14 21:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
