(7450306, 1179034, 114285, '<td valign="top">This looks like a Wendy shot ;) <br/> <br/> The lighting is just superb definitely nailed that. However the T-shirt is very distracting I would''ve gone for a plain black T-shirt instead,  abstracts logos and prints on T-shirts always distract the eye to what''s really going on, especially in a busy composition like this one.  Ditto also for the aeroplane, plain paper next time,  yeah yeah I can hear you saying, but I didn''t have any plain paper.   Nearly everyone has a photocopier :-) editing is awesome though.<br/> <br/> I hope he still got to eat his egg :-)  already voted.</td>', 'This looks like a Wendy shot ;)   The lighting is just superb definitely nailed that. However the T-shirt is very distracting I would''ve gone for a plain black T-shirt instead,  abstracts logos and prints on T-shirts always distract the eye to what''s really going on, especially in a busy composition like this one.  Ditto also for the aeroplane, plain paper next time,  yeah yeah I can hear you saying, but I didn''t have any plain paper.   Nearly everyone has a photocopier :-) editing is awesome though.  I hope he still got to eat his egg :-)  already voted.', '2016-04-14 21:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
